			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">No Section 16 Individual or Key Employee listed on <b>Exhibit A </b>may trade in Company securities outside of the Company trading window described in Section V.B below.</p>
