<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify;">Information is &#8220;nonpublic&#8221; if it has not been disseminated to investors through a widely circulated news or wire service (such as Dow Jones, Bloomberg, PR Newswire, etc.) or through a public filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;). For the purposes of this Policy, information will be not considered public until after the close of trading on the second full trading day following the Company&#8217;s widespread public release of the information.</p>

